0..78 Comment "//! Renaming twice is renaming once, the renaming case of the fusion lemmas of"
79..96 Comment "//! Allais et al."
97..198 Comment "//! [Allais-2021-a_type_and_scope_safe_universe_of_syntaxes_with_binding_their_semantics_and_proofs]:"
199..272 Comment "//! a term renamed by `a1` then `a2` is the term renamed by `a3` when the"
273..350 Comment "//! lookups agree at every index, and likewise for two composites. Each is an"
351..427 Comment "//! induction on the term whose hypothesis is the pointwise one, lifted once"
428..496 Comment "//! under each abstraction; an application\'s two paths are joined by"
497..513 Comment "//! `Path.walk`."
514..517 Comment "//!"
518..627 Comment "//! - cites: [Allais-2021-a_type_and_scope_safe_universe_of_syntaxes_with_binding_their_semantics_and_proofs]"
628..631 Comment "//!"
